>>
Rule 1 (input tensor x must be real-valued and not complex)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 3 (input tensor x must not be a complex-valued tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 9 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 10
>>
Rule 4 (dimension sizes of the input tensor must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (minimum value of the non-empty input tensor must not exceed its maximum value)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
